sgp 2

given
  point A
  h1 = hyperbola(A)
    a1: a(h1) = 2
    b1: b(h1) = 4

construct
  point B on h1
  segment AB
    θ1: angle(xaxis, AB) = 55°

find
  d1: dist(A, B)

where
  A (2.0015718701408716, 0.9999932135673184)
  h1 a 2 b 4 angle 0° [fixed angle]
  B (4.85842812985913, 5.080006786432682)
  a1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  b1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  θ1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  d1 label (0.3, 0.3)
